# Method: CRAT-Pred (Deep Learning)
# Project: Diploma_thesis
# Chapter: 5.2 

# Description:
# This file summarizes the experimental results of the CRAT-Pred deep learning model for vehicle trajectory prediction.
# Each scenario was simulated in the CARLA simulator and includes visual, numerical, and tabular evaluation results.
# For every scenario, the following outputs are available:
#   1) One CARLA image showing predicted and actual vehicle trajectories.
#   2) One plot (PNG) comparing predicted vs ground truth trajectories.
#   3) One CSV file containing detailed metrics per timestep and per second.

[EXPERIMENTAL_SETUP]
Simulator = CARLA
Prediction_Method = CRAT-Pred (Crystal Graph Convolutional Network + Multi-Head Self-Attention)
Prediction_Horizon = 3.0 s
Sampling_Interval = 0.05 s
Evaluation_Metrics = Average Displacement Error (ADE), Miss Rate (MR)
Scenarios = 3 (Straight, Right Turn, Left Turn)

