[SUMMARY]
Overall_Observations:
- The CRAT-Pred model achieves near-perfect trajectory alignment in all tested scenarios.
- Both ADE and MR remain close to zero, demonstrating high spatial accuracy and consistency.
- The model captures multi-modal future paths and selects the optimal mode per frame.
- These results significantly outperform the kinematics-based baseline, confirming the effectiveness of the deep learning approach.

